 nteers\, or concessionaire naturalists. If they are not available to lead
  hikes\, self-guided interpretive trail booklets are available. Guided hi
 ke locations\, distances\, and departure times will be announced after yo
 ur arrival on the island during the visitor orientation. Please check wit
 h a ranger\, volunteer\, or concessionaire employee for more information.
URL:https://www.nps.gov/chis/planyourvisit/calendar.htm
END:VEVENT
