DESCRIPTION:Los Padres Council\nhttps://global.scoutingevent.com/053-11600
 1\n\n\n\nScouting America – Los Padres Council is pleased to invite you
  to partner with us for our annual\nSalute to Scouting\ncelebration\, tak
 ing place on\nThursday\, October 29\, 2026\n\, at the historic\nSanta Bar
 bara Club\n.\nThis signature event brings together business and community
  leaders from across the Central Coast to celebrate the leadership\, serv
 ice\, and character development. This year\, we are proud to honor\nBill 
 Macfadyen\n\, founder and publisher of Noozhawk.com\, receiving the\nNati
 onal Outstanding Ea
URL:https://global.scoutingevent.com/053-116001
END:VEVENT
