 isit/calendar.htm\n\n\n\nBehind every landmark at Cabrillo National Monum
 ent is a story. Join a ranger for a 30-minute guided walk introducing the
  people\, places\, and events that shaped Cabrillo National Monument. Fro
 m Juan Rodríguez Cabrillo's 1542 expedition and the history of the Old P
 oint Loma Lighthouse to the creation and growth of the monument itself\, 
 discover how this remarkable landscape became the park visitors experienc
 e today. Whether you're visiting for the first time or returning to explo
 re again\, this pro
URL:https://www.nps.gov/cabr/planyourvisit/calendar.htm
END:VEVENT
